{%- comment -%}
  Xavia fit finder: the default size charts, as plain JSON. BODY measurements in cm (not garment measurements),
  copied from the store's chart images IT_MENS_JACKET.jpg and IT_WOMEN.jpg (chest = petto, waist = vita).
  A size range is [from, to]; each size starts where the size below ends.
  Which products use which chart: see xavia-fit-finder.liquid. One product can override with the JSON
  metafield xavia.fit_chart (a whole chart, or { "men": "<key or chart>", "women": "<key or chart>" }).
  Measures the finder knows: chest, waist, hips, inseam, hand, handLength, height.
{%- endcomment -%}
